# Sheets (Prokat)

- Prefer modal bottom sheets (thumb reach). Do not add new centered `AlertDialog` UIs.
- Open via `PurposeSheet.show` → `AppBottomSheet.show` (finite content) or `showScrollable` (long lists).
- Do not call raw `showModalBottomSheet` outside a `*Sheet` class.
- Buttons inside sheets → ui_kit elevated/outlined; destructive → `AppElevatedButton.destructive`.
- Chrome tokens → `AppDimens.sheet*`.
